Third-party software and models
-------------------------------
None of these are copied into this repository; they are installed from requirements.txt or downloaded at run time,
each under its own licence:

- Ultralytics (YOLOE detector and ByteTrack tracker): AGPL-3.0.
- Ultralytics' CLIP fork (YOLOE's text tokenizer, installed from GitHub): AGPL-3.0.
- YOLOE weights (yoloe-26m-seg.pt): published by Ultralytics under AGPL-3.0.
- MobileCLIP2 text encoder (mobileclip2_b.ts, used by YOLOE): published by Apple under its own model licence; check
  it before any commercial use.
- Qwen models (qwen3.5:4b through Ollama; Qwen3-VL-8B on Amazon SageMaker): Apache-2.0, per their model cards.
- segno (QR codes for device pairing): BSD-3-Clause.
- aiortc (WebRTC): BSD-3-Clause.
- lap (linear assignment for ByteTrack): BSD-2-Clause.
- MCP Python SDK (the voice side's MCP server): MIT.
- Android app (fetched by Gradle): AndroidX and Jetpack Compose, Media3, Kotlin coroutines and serialization, OkHttp,
  Retrofit, Coil, ZXing core and stream-webrtc-android: Apache-2.0. Firebase Cloud Messaging and ML Kit barcode
  scanning: Google's terms for those SDKs.
